  "releaseNotes": "TinyEXR.NET 1.3.0 introduces the breaking V3-only API, now 3.1: official OpenEXR 3.5.3 verification, legal deep NONE/RLE/ZIPS only, official LJ2K/ZSTD IDs, contexts, resource budgets, typed attributes and Preview. V1 models and fallback paths are removed. Rebuild consumers; see docs/migration-v3.1.md and docs/migration-v3-only.md.",
